<section id="S7" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">VII </span><span id="S7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Appendix</span></h2>

<section id="S7.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S7.SS1.6" class="ltx_text">VII-A</span> </span><span id="S7.SS1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Leiden Community Detection Algorithm</span></h3>

<div id="S7.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Leiden algorithm <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">25</a>]</cite> is an advanced graph clustering technique developed to address limitations of the Louvain method by guaranteeing well-connected communities without compromising computational efficiency. The algorithm operates in three key phases: (1) local moving, where nodes are iteratively reassigned to optimize modularity; (2) refinement, which ensures community connectivity through partitioning; and (3) aggregation, where the network is coarsened for hierarchical clustering. This algorithm is widely used, and its open-source Python implementation is well-documented and accessible. We present the algorithm for Leiden algorithm in Algorithm <a href="#algorithm1" title="In VII-A Leiden Community Detection Algorithm ‣ VII Appendix ‣ ZhiFangDanTai: Fine-tuning Graph-based Retrieval-Augmented Generation Model for Traditional Chinese Medicine Formula" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm">
<div id="algorithm1.3" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.3.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span>Graph <math id="algorithm1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G(V,E)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math>, resolution parameter <math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math>, max iterations <math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{\text{in}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mo>∑</mo><mtext>in</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{\text{in}}</annotation></semantics></math>: internal edge weights in <math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{\text{tot}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mo>∑</mo><mtext>tot</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{\text{tot}}</annotation></semantics></math>: total edge weights of <math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{v}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{v}</annotation></semantics></math>: degree of <math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>v</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v</annotation></semantics></math>.
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.3.2.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span>Community partition <math id="algorithm1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}</annotation></semantics></math>.
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.3" class="ltx_listingline">Initialize: Partition <math id="algorithm1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}=\{\{v\}|v\in V\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}=\{\{v\}|v\in V\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="algorithm1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="algorithm1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q=-\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q=-\infty</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.4" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> <em id="algorithm1.3.4.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t&lt;t_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t&lt;t_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.3.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">or</span> <math id="algorithm1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta Q=\frac{\sum_{\text{in}}+k_{v,\text{in}}}{2m}-\gamma\cdot\frac{(\sum_{\text{tot}}+k_{v})\cdot k_{v}}{(2m)^{2}}&lt;\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel="-1"><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">in</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">in</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle scriptlevel="-1"><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">tot</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>v</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta Q=\frac{\sum_{\text{in}}+k_{v,\text{in}}}{2m}-\gamma\cdot\frac{(\sum_{\text{tot}}+k_{v})\cdot k_{v}}{(2m)^{2}}&lt;\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.3.4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.5" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.3.5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Phase 1: Local Moving </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm1.3.6.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\in V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\in V</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.3.6.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">in random order</span></em> <span id="algorithm1.3.6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}_{\text{old}}=\vec{C}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}_{\text{old}}=\vec{C}(v)</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}_{\text{new}}=argmax_{\vec{C}}\Delta Q(v\rightarrow\vec{C})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}_{\text{new}}=argmax_{\vec{C}}\Delta Q(v\rightarrow\vec{C})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.3.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><math id="algorithm1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta Q=\frac{\sum_{\text{in}}+k_{v,\text{in}}}{2m}-\gamma\cdot\frac{(\sum_{\text{tot}}+k_{v})\cdot k_{v}}{(2m)^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel="-1"><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">in</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">in</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle scriptlevel="-1"><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">tot</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>v</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta Q=\frac{\sum_{\text{in}}+k_{v,\text{in}}}{2m}-\gamma\cdot\frac{(\sum_{\text{tot}}+k_{v})\cdot k_{v}}{(2m)^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.3.9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter"> </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.10" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.3.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm1.3.10.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta Q(v\rightarrow\vec{C}_{\text{new}})&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">new</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta Q(v\rightarrow\vec{C}_{\text{new}})&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.3.10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.11" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}.\text{move}(v,\vec{C}_{\text{new}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mrow><mtext>move</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}.\text{move}(v,\vec{C}_{\text{new}})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.12" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Update <math id="algorithm1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{\text{in}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mo>∑</mo><mtext>in</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{\text{in}}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="algorithm1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{\text{tot}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mo>∑</mo><mtext>tot</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{\text{tot}}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="algorithm1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}_{\text{old}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mtext>old</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}_{\text{old}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="algorithm1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}_{\text{new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mtext>new</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}_{\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.13" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> end if
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.14" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> end for
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.15" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.3.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.3.15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Phase 2: Refinement </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.16" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.3.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm1.3.16.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}_{k}\in\vec{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}_{k}\in\vec{C}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.3.16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.17" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Split <math id="algorithm1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> into connected components <math id="algorithm1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\vec{C}_{k}^{1},\vec{C}_{k}^{2},\ldots\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\vec{C}_{k}^{1},\vec{C}_{k}^{2},\ldots\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.18" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Merge subsets with <math id="algorithm1.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta Q=\frac{\sum_{\text{in}}+k_{v,\text{in}}}{2m}-\gamma\cdot\frac{(\sum_{\text{tot}}+k_{v})\cdot k_{v}}{(2m)^{2}}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel="-1"><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>in</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle scriptlevel="-1"><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>tot</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>v</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta Q=\frac{\sum_{\text{in}}+k_{v,\text{in}}}{2m}-\gamma\cdot\frac{(\sum_{\text{tot}}+k_{v})\cdot k_{v}}{(2m)^{2}}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.19" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> end for
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.20" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.3.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.3.20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Phase 3: Aggregation </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.21" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G,\vec{C}\leftarrow\text{aggregate\_network}(G,\text{refined\_partition})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>aggregate_network</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>refined_partition</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G,\vec{C}\leftarrow\text{aggregate\_network}(G,\text{refined\_partition})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.22" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=t+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=t+1</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.23" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.3.23.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <em id="algorithm1.3.23.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vec{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec{C}</annotation></semantics></math></em>

</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.24" class="ltx_listingline">end while
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.25" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>Leiden Community Detection</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S7.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S7.SS2.6" class="ltx_text">VII-B</span> </span><span id="S7.SS2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">MapReduce Process</span></h3>

<div id="S7.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide pseudocode in Algorithm <a href="#algorithm2" title="In VII-D Hyper-parameter Analysis ‣ VII Appendix ‣ ZhiFangDanTai: Fine-tuning Graph-based Retrieval-Augmented Generation Model for Traditional Chinese Medicine Formula" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> to show how GraphRAG utilizes the MapReduce pattern to process large-scale knowledge graphs in parallel and generate more comprehensive responses through distributed computing. The Map phase extracts relevant information from different portions of the knowledge graph, while the reduce phase synthesizes these partial results.
In practice, we employ the LlamaIndex library (https://docs.llamaindex.ai/en/stable/) to perform retrieval and generation tasks in GraphRAG, including the MapReduce process for generating answers in response to symptom description queries <math id="S7.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
